# Kraken Futures API credentials live at ~/.frosk/ (outside this repo) and are
# loaded via spring.config.import — see kraken-credentials.template.properties.
# ~/.frosk/ can never be committed since it's outside the working tree; these
# two lines are just a safety net in case the real file ever ends up inside the
# repo by mistake (e.g. someone copies the template next to itself).
/.frosk/
/kraken-credentials.properties
